{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28092","headline":"赠宗静上人 · 雍陶","name":"赠宗静上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世上方传教，山中未得归。\n闲花飘讲席，驯鸽污禅衣。\n积雨谁过寺，残钟自掩扉。\n寒来垂顶帽，白发剃应稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28092.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28092","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}